-  <p node="[object Object]" class="" data-ag-id="ag-n-304">Using the Agentic TDD protocol, I manually spun up an isolated local Git branch, wrote the failing OCC and partial write resilience tests, successfully implemented the Two-Phase Decoupled Sync in <code node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-pre-wrap" data-ag-id="ag-n-305" style="word-break: break-word;">obsidian_sync.py</code>, passed the Bounded Pre-Flight Gate (<code node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-pre-wrap" data-ag-id="ag-n-306" style="word-break: break-word;">pytest</code>), and secured the explicit approval of the Stage 4 Iterative-Implement Style Expert.</p>
-  <p node="[object Object]" class="" data-ag-id="ag-n-307">I've generated the patch, securely merged it back into your <code node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-pre-wrap" data-ag-id="ag-n-308" style="word-break: break-word;">main</code> branch, and cleaned up the temporary files.</p>
